<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00114/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一只普通的雄性黑色英国短毛猫，当注视该个体的人类认为该个体患有某种疾病时，该个体会在几天之内表现出该疾病的症状。研究表明，出现的疾病可以由正常的治疗手段治愈。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/04/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>黑龙江省██市一居民家中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被收容于Site-CN-██生物异常区，未经Dr.王██批准禁止饲养员外的人类与其接触。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>我警告你们，下次再让我发现有人未经我允许跑到它的收容间，拿它取乐，我就把那个没有人性的混蛋立即处决。——Dr.王██</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00114" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00114" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00114-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zixxxx" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5180689); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5180689&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608190826" alt="zixxxx" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5180689)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zixxxx" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5180689); return false;">zixxxx</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587820422 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">25 Apr 2020 13:13</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00371/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>数组硅胶制冰模具，任何由其制造成的方冰在融化过程都会不间断发出近似人类孩童的尖叫声。液面或冰面上端会以水为原料形成一只高举着的微型手臂，直至冰块彻底融化。冰块消融成的水将在约莫十五分钟后转化为人类血液。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/8/20<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>广东省深圳市一间塑胶模具制造工厂<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放于Area-CN-07标准物品收容保险柜中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>自回收到的第二十三副异常模具夹格中回收到一张便条，疑似指明这批异常产品的实际制造者。——研究员汪唐宋</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Cheers！致每一位为我们献上美酒的Mr.Ice。你肯定要为此下地狱了！</p>
</blockquote>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00371" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00371" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00371-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rye-travis" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3290685); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3290685&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608190826" alt="Rye Travis" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3290685)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rye-travis" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3290685); return false;">Rye Travis</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1597930110 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">20 Aug 2020 13:28</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00335/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<strong>项目描述：</strong>一行带有模因的文字，会使观察者产生极度反感并拒绝记忆位于与项目之前的内容。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>各类书籍<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>未被完全收容<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">以下为一个典型范例</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">收起</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<h3><span>要求全文背诵</span></h3>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00335" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00335" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00335-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6158338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608190826" alt="LEEEEEEOOOOOO" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6158338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;">LEEEEEEOOOOOO</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1595921948 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 Jul 2020 07:39</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00204/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>由██国产的一部华█手机。当有非该国国籍的人手持该项目，并以夸张的表情和语气说出夸赞有关该国的话时，该项目会变成一部iP█one手机。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>一名俄罗斯籍男子手中。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被保存于Site-CN-57中的一个低危异常储存柜中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>我一直支持国产！嘿！S█ri，我的█文好吗？——Fula████</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00204" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00204" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00204-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-fishbone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6127045); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6127045&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608190827" alt="Dr Fishbone" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6127045)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-fishbone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6127045); return false;">Dr Fishbone</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589607754 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">16 May 2020 05:42</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00034/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一只自我收容的逆模因家猫（<em>Felis catus</em>），无法被标准认知阻值低于13者察觉。在叼走客座研究员Rachud的早餐后因后者在工作中使用了记忆强化剂而发现。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2015/██/█<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-75附近<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>在站点员工的<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">胁迫</span>意愿下，研究员Rachud利用工作之便诱导其每天定时从Site-CN-75-B一处后门中获取食物，食物的费用由所有员工共同负担。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>莫名其妙，看不见的猫有什么好吸的。</em>——研究员Rachud</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00034" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00034" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00034-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rachud" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4516971); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4516971&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608190827" alt="Rachud" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4516971)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rachud" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4516971); return false;">Rachud</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1586172967 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">06 Apr 2020 11:36</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00059/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">一支法制MAS36步枪，质感异常柔软且具有麦香味</span>一条法式长棍面包，具有认知危害，可使任何观察到该项目的人类认为该项目是一支法制MAS36步枪。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-21员工食堂<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>已被食用<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>今日乳法</em>——Dr.Jackson</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00059" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00059" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00059-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4546338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608190827" alt="miku1314" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4546338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;">miku1314</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1586756541 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">13 Apr 2020 05:42</span></p>
